      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think 50 materials, and 250K polygons needs to be the average awfully optimized avatar, that needs to go to this section. Because 30 materials may seem like a lot, but it isn't really THAT much.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
